# Wiki Schema

## Wiki location

- Storage: OpenViking
- Root: `<selected at operation time>`

## Page types

- `source` in `sources/`
- `entity` in `entities/`
- `concept` in `concepts/`
- `synthesis` in `synthesis/`

## Frontmatter

Every ordinary page requires `type`, `title`, `tags`, `created`, and `updated`.
Source pages also use `authors`, `url` when applicable, `raw`, and `ingested`.
Non-source pages use `sources` containing bare source-page slugs.

Repository inventory anchors use `kind: repo-entity` and require `type`, `name`, `origin`, `web_url`,
and `description`. Legacy repository pages without the marker remain ordinary entities.

## Size and links

- Soft cap: 400 lines.
- Hard cap: 800 lines.
- Frontmatter source references are bare slugs; body cross-references use `[[wikilinks]]`.

## Log

Entries use `## [YYYY-MM-DD] <operation> | <description>` with one or two sentences and one primary
artifact link. Define the accepted operation keywords in `log.md`.
